<aside class="support-card"><h2>Support is available</h2><p>If difficulties persist, worsen or interfere with daily life, consider speaking with a qualified mental-health professional. You do not need a particular result to ask for help.</p><p>If you feel at risk of harming yourself or cannot stay safe, seek immediate help through local emergency services or the nearest emergency department and contact someone you trust. Do not wait to finish this form.</p></aside>
